      `the foreign company is subject to regulatory disclosure requirements` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the foreign company is subject to requirements relating to adequate transparency in respect of its beneficial owners` IS A BOOLEAN
      `those requirements are imposed through stock exchange rules, law or other enforceable means` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`sch 15 para 1(c) the foreign company is within paragraph 1(c)` MEANS
        `the foreign company's shares are listed on a securities exchange in a country or territory outside Singapore`
    AND `the foreign company is subject to regulatory disclosure requirements`
    AND `the foreign company is subject to requirements relating to adequate transparency in respect of its beneficial owners`
    AND `those requirements are imposed through stock exchange rules, law or other enforceable means`

