§ `Sixteenth Schedule paragraph 1: significant control`

-- "For the purposes of Part 11A, an individual or a legal entity has significant control over a company or foreign company if the individual or legal entity (a) holds the right, directly or indirectly,
-- to appoint or remove the directors ... who hold a majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors ... on all or substantially all matters; (b) holds, directly or indirectly, more than 25%
-- of the rights to vote on those matters that are to be decided upon by a vote of the members ...; or (c) has the right to exercise, or actually exercises, significant influence or control over the company"
-- src:29443 | (a) holds the right, directly or indirectly, to appoint or remove the directors
-- src:29444 | or equivalent persons of the company or foreign company who hold a
-- src:29445 | majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors or equivalent
-- src:29446 | persons on all or substantially all matters;
@ref sch 16 para 1(a) (src:29443-29446)
GIVEN `the person holds the right, directly or indirectly, to appoint or remove the directors or equivalent persons who hold a majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors or equivalent persons on all or substantially all matters` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 1(a) the person has significant control by the right to appoint or remove the directors` MEANS
    `the person holds the right, directly or indirectly, to appoint or remove the directors or equivalent persons who hold a majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors or equivalent persons on all or substantially all matters`

-- src:29448 | (b) holds, directly or indirectly, more than 25% of the rights to vote on
-- src:29449 | those matters that are to be decided upon by a vote of the members or
-- src:29450 | equivalent persons of the company or foreign company; or
@ref sch 16 para 1(b) (src:29448-29450)
GIVEN `the percentage of the rights to vote on the matters decided by a vote of the members that the person holds, directly or indirectly` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 1(b) the person has significant control by holding more than 25% of the rights to vote` MEANS
    `the percentage of the rights to vote on the matters decided by a vote of the members that the person holds, directly or indirectly` GREATER THAN 25

-- src:29440 | 1. For the purposes of Part 11A, an individual or a legal entity has significant
-- src:29441 | control over a company or foreign company if the individual or legal entity —
-- src:29443 | (a) holds the right, directly or indirectly, to appoint or remove the directors
-- src:29444 | or equivalent persons of the company or foreign company who hold a
-- src:29445 | majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors or equivalent
-- src:29446 | persons on all or substantially all matters;
-- src:29448 | (b) holds, directly or indirectly, more than 25% of the rights to vote on
-- src:29449 | those matters that are to be decided upon by a vote of the members or
-- src:29450 | equivalent persons of the company or foreign company; or
-- src:29452 | (c) has the right to exercise, or actually exercises, significant influence or
-- src:29453 | control over the company or foreign company.
@ref sch 16 para 1 (src:29440-29453)
GIVEN `the person holds the right, directly or indirectly, to appoint or remove the directors or equivalent persons who hold a majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors or equivalent persons on all or substantially all matters` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the percentage of the rights to vote on the matters decided by a vote of the members that the person holds, directly or indirectly` IS A NUMBER
      `the person has the right to exercise, or actually exercises, significant influence or control over the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 1 the person has significant control over the company or foreign company` MEANS
    IF     `sch 16 para 1(a) the person has significant control by the right to appoint or remove the directors` `the person holds the right, directly or indirectly, to appoint or remove the directors or equivalent persons who hold a majority of the voting rights at meetings of the directors or equivalent persons on all or substantially all matters`
        OR `sch 16 para 1(b) the person has significant control by holding more than 25% of the rights to vote` `the percentage of the rights to vote on the matters decided by a vote of the members that the person holds, directly or indirectly`
        OR `the person has the right to exercise, or actually exercises, significant influence or control over the company or foreign company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words; delegated-definitions ruling (a)): "an individual or a legal entity has significant control over a company or foreign company if the individual or legal entity (a) ...; (b) ...; or (c) ..." (a definition that names its heads for Part 11A; none holds)

§ `Sixteenth Schedule paragraphs 2 and 3: significant interest`

-- 2(1): "an individual or a legal entity has a significant interest in a company or foreign company having a share capital -- (a) if ... has an interest in more than 25% of the shares ...; or
-- (b) if (i) ... has an interest in one or more voting shares ...; and (ii) the total votes attached to that share, or those shares, is more than 25% of the total voting power"
-- src:29457 | 2.—(1) For the purposes of Part 11A, an individual or a legal entity has a
-- src:29458 | significant interest in a company or foreign company having a share capital —
-- src:29460 | (a) if the individual or legal entity (as the case may be) has an interest in
-- src:29461 | more than 25% of the shares in the company or foreign company; or
-- src:29468 | (b) if —
-- src:29470 | (i) the individual or legal entity (as the case may be) has an interest
-- src:29471 | in one or more voting shares in the company or foreign
-- src:29472 | company; and
-- src:29474 | (ii) the total votes attached to that share, or those shares, is more
-- src:29475 | than 25% of the total voting power in the company or foreign
-- src:29476 | company.
@ref sch 16 para 2(1) (src:29457-29476)
GIVEN `the person has an interest in a percentage of the shares in the company or foreign company of` IS A NUMBER
      `the person has an interest in one or more voting shares in the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the percentage of the total voting power in the company or foreign company that the votes attached to those voting shares make up` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 2(1) the person has a significant interest in the company or foreign company having a share capital` MEANS
    IF     `the person has an interest in a percentage of the shares in the company or foreign company of` GREATER THAN 25
        OR (`the person has an interest in one or more voting shares in the company or foreign company` AND `the percentage of the total voting power in the company or foreign company that the votes attached to those voting shares make up` GREATER THAN 25)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words; delegated-definitions ruling (a)): "has a significant interest in a company or foreign company having a share capital -- (a) if ... more than 25% of the shares; or (b) if ... one or more voting shares ... more than 25% of the total voting power" (a definition that names its heads for Part 11A; neither holds)

-- 2(2): "In sub-paragraph (1)(b), 'voting share' does not include any treasury share or any share mentioned in section 21(4B) or (6C)."
-- src:29478 | (2) In sub‑paragraph (1)(b), “voting share” does not include any treasury share
-- src:29479 | or any share mentioned in section 21(4B) or (6C).
@ref sch 16 para 2(2) (src:29478-29479)
GIVEN `the share is a treasury share` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the share is a share mentioned in section 21(4B) or (6C)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 2(2) the share is a voting share for sub-paragraph (1)(b)` MEANS
    IF `the share is a treasury share` OR `the share is a share mentioned in section 21(4B) or (6C)`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "'voting share' does not include any treasury share or any share mentioned in section 21(4B) or (6C)" (a flat negative)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the sub-paragraph says only what a voting share does not include; whether any other share is a voting share it does not say

-- src:29481 | 3. For the purposes of Part 11A, an individual or a legal entity has a significant
-- src:29482 | interest in a company or foreign company that does not have a share capital if the
-- src:29483 | individual or legal entity holds, whether directly or indirectly, a right to share in
-- src:29484 | more than 25% of the capital, or more than 25% of the profits, of the company or
-- src:29485 | foreign company.
@ref sch 16 para 3 (src:29481-29485)
GIVEN `the percentage of the capital of the company or foreign company that the person holds a right to share in, directly or indirectly` IS A NUMBER
      `the percentage of the profits of the company or foreign company that the person holds a right to share in, directly or indirectly` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 3 the person has a significant interest in the company or foreign company that does not have a share capital` MEANS
    IF `the percentage of the capital of the company or foreign company that the person holds a right to share in, directly or indirectly` GREATER THAN 25 OR `the percentage of the profits of the company or foreign company that the person holds a right to share in, directly or indirectly` GREATER THAN 25
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words; delegated-definitions ruling (a)): "has a significant interest in a company or foreign company that does not have a share capital if the individual or legal entity holds, whether directly or indirectly, a right to share in more than 25% of the capital, or more than 25% of the profits" (a definition that names its heads for Part 11A; neither holds)

§ `Sixteenth Schedule paragraph 4: supplementary provisions`

-- 4(1): "Subject to sub-paragraphs (2), (3) and (5), subsections (1A) to (6A), (8), (9) and (10) of section 7 apply in determining whether a person has an interest in a share."
-- The keel's s 7 functions do the work; the "Subject to" exceptions are the sub-paragraphs below.
-- src:29489 | 4.—(1) Subject to sub‑paragraphs (2), (3) and (5), subsections (1A) to (6A), (8),
-- src:29490 | (9) and (10) of section 7 apply in determining whether a person has an interest in a
-- src:29491 | share.
@ref sch 16 para 4(1) (src:29489-29491)
GIVEN `the subsection of section 7 is one of subsections (1A) to (6A), (8), (9) and (10)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 16 para 4(1) the subsection of section 7 applies in determining whether the person has an interest in a share` MEANS
